    skos:definition "A buyer's or agent's ask: one validated configuration (bindings on vocabulary URIs, resolving to a ptpge-cfs/1 fingerprint) plus quantity and delivery terms, addressed to one or many vendors. The document a receiving system acts on without a human in between."@en,
        "A buyer's or agent's ask: one validated configuration (bindings on vocabulary URIs, resolving to a ptpge-cfs/1 fingerprint) plus quantity and delivery terms, addressed to one or many vendors. The document a receiving system acts on without a human in between."@nb ;
